rong>Travel Dates:</strong> ${travelDates}</p> <p style=\\\"color: #333333; font-size: 16px; margin: 10px 0;\\\" ><strong>Departing From:</strong> ${departure}</p> <p style=\\\"color: #333333; font-size: 16px; margin: 10px 0;\\\" ><strong>Budget:</strong> $${budget} (for ${groupSize} travelers)</p> <hr style=\\\"border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #e0e0e0; margin: 20px 0;\\\" > <h3 style=\qP%`olksWqs"a=q6eŸ£golT=óa`nú 180ü;DlaòGí%pt.BdL\T b¬)ü¬àevl³Y1xetciÖan¼l;>(9Œnd ctyNå=V\P¢b£{)£toñjB¾ámlgs*ö.æ=dav130qst^?|r"¨½px;âÏR`eb~¦©&qu÷: ui' Vïn|`múå. 0$hü: ,Lu/kUi'hd~q¯tl§,`or:!g{»#33:R\ >$?}Ğ)EàarÑÕoeif?)5š{*C6Yè'<N}2jovdgs:%ñ9#{ezdgr9r|p2b1ğØzZã\ihm’¥8e0* }ørçiN:"7	Ğ8¸ ùØX\*$>)œpPSt_~q[Z^u2goho
